Description: Querencia Desktop panel and desktop (alpha)
 Querencia Desktop is a classic desktop in the style of GNOME 2 /
 Ubuntu 10.04, written in Rust with GTK 4 for Wayland (labwc).
 .
 This package contains the two shell programs:
  * querencia-panel: top panel with the Applications, Places and System
    menus and a clock; bottom panel with window list and workspace
    switcher;
  * querencia-desktop: desktop background, desktop icons and the
    desktop context menu.
 .
 They need a wlroots compositor with the layer-shell protocol and are
 normally started by querencia-session. This is an alpha release.
